<HR><BR>
<B><FONT COLOR="#FF0000"><FONT SIZE=+2>Area Info</FONT></FONT></B> <BR>
<BR>
<B>Dirs:</b> Lucentium <BR>
<BR>
<b>Coder:</b> Madrid, opened in November, 2000.<BR>
<BR>
<b>General Descrip:</b><br><br>

The city of Duzelton is being flooded by an evil monster.
Help the Duzes fight against this tyrant.  Level quest 41 too.
 

